1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:00,739
WAIT...

2
00:00:01,079 --> 00:00:02,376
THEY'RE DESTROYING THE WALL?!

3
00:00:02,716 --> 00:00:04,960
I JUST ARRIVED IN 1989!

4
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:10,610
I was standing in Berlin when thousands of people suddenly rushed toward a giant concrete wall.

5
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:15,117
For 28 years, this wall had separated East and West Berlin.

6
00:00:15,457 --> 00:00:18,323
Families, friends, even entire lives were divided.

7
00:00:18,973 --> 00:00:23,107
But on November 9, 1989, something unbelievable happened.

8
00:00:23,447 --> 00:00:25,174
People started crossing the border!

9
00:00:26,273 --> 00:00:28,157
Some were crying, others were laughing.

10
00:00:28,497 --> 00:00:31,647
People climbed onto the wall and started smashing it with hammers!

11
00:00:33,373 --> 00:00:35,198
And for the first time in decades...

12
00:00:35,538 --> 00:00:38,029
people could finally hug their families again.

13
00:00:38,923 --> 00:00:40,480
I thought history was over...

14
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:43,140
until my time machine started flashing again!

15
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:45,078
SUBSCRIBE TO HISTORY WORLD!
